{
  "_comment": [
    "Every file served from the static bucket, and the S3 key it lands on.",
    "",
    "One source of truth on purpose: service/static/sync.sh uploads exactly",
    "this list and tests/test_static_assets.py checks it against what the two",
    "HTML pages actually reference. A file referenced by a page but missing",
    "here is the /app.js bug again -- the page loads and one feature is dead",
    "-- which has shipped five times in this project against the ALB.",
    "",
    "Keys mirror the URL paths exactly, because every reference in the pages",
    "is RELATIVE (src=\"app.js\", href=\"icons/icon-192.png\"). Renaming a key",
    "silently 404s the reference.",
    "",
    "Note 'admin', 'metrics' and 'lab' have no extension: they are one page,",
    "control/lab.html (3.132 Stage 4), published at all three paths so the",
    "consoles' old links keep working -- the page picks its tab from the path.",
    "The keys are extensionless, so the content type is set explicitly rather",
    "than guessed.",
    "",
    "cache: 'none' for the scripts, stylesheets and pages, matching the",
    "no-cache headers robot/server.py and admin_server.py already send --",
    "this project deliberately does not use content-hashed filenames, so a",
    "cached app.js is a stale UI nobody can explain. Icons and the manifest",
    "are immutable in practice and cache for a day."
  ],
  "assets": [
    {"src": "web-twin/index.html",              "key": "index.html",              "type": "text/html; charset=utf-8",       "cache": "none"},
    {"src": "web-twin/strings.js",              "key": "strings.js",              "type": "application/javascript",         "cache": "none"},
    {"src": "web-twin/app.js",                  "key": "app.js",                  "type": "application/javascript",         "cache": "none"},
    {"src": "web-twin/js/qr.js",          "key": "js/qr.js",              "type": "application/javascript",         "cache": "none"},
    {"src": "web-twin/js/icons.js",       "key": "js/icons.js",           "type": "application/javascript",         "cache": "none"},
    {"src": "web-shared/ui.css",                "key": "ui.css",                  "type": "text/css; charset=utf-8",        "cache": "none"},
    {"src": "web-twin/twin.css",                "key": "twin.css",                "type": "text/css; charset=utf-8",        "cache": "none"},
    {"src": "web-twin/manifest.json",           "key": "manifest.json",           "type": "application/manifest+json",      "cache": "day"},
    {"src": "web-twin/icons/icon-192.png",      "key": "icons/icon-192.png",      "type": "image/png",                      "cache": "day"},
    {"src": "web-twin/icons/icon-512.png",      "key": "icons/icon-512.png",      "type": "image/png",                      "cache": "day"},
    {"src": "web-twin/icons/apple-touch-icon.png", "key": "icons/apple-touch-icon.png", "type": "image/png",               "cache": "day"},
    {"src": "control/lab.html",                 "key": "admin",                   "type": "text/html; charset=utf-8",       "cache": "none"},
    {"src": "control/lab.html",                 "key": "metrics",                 "type": "text/html; charset=utf-8",       "cache": "none"},
    {"src": "control/lab.html",                 "key": "lab",                     "type": "text/html; charset=utf-8",       "cache": "none"},
    {"src": "control/lab.css",                  "key": "lab.css",                 "type": "text/css; charset=utf-8",        "cache": "none"},
    {"src": "control/lab.js",                   "key": "lab.js",                  "type": "application/javascript",         "cache": "none"},
    {"src": "control/admin.js",                 "key": "admin.js",                "type": "application/javascript",         "cache": "none"},
    {"src": "control/metrics.js",               "key": "metrics.js",              "type": "application/javascript",         "cache": "none"}
  ]
}
